# Stage-B server integration requirement:
# Every provider call made after ConversationSegmentStore.begin_provider_intent(...)
# must call lease.run(..., allow_failover=False). The existing outer
# foreground transport recursion in handle_openai_responses must also be disabled
# for that request. An unresolved durable provider intent then becomes the only
# safe retry boundary until a typed lower-layer proof of NO_REMOTE_PROGRESS exists.
